      "cooked": "<p>I'm wondering if there's any plans for things like a challenges mode for villains (things like the one houserule that the Ennead's cards activate all their triggers), a Freedom Six fight vs. Iron Legacy, or things like using all three generations of Legacy? Or some kind of 'make your own scenario' program along those lines?</p><p>I think it'd be neat. And also that Greatest, Finest and young Legacy would make a devastating team together.</p>",
